tmp/phase-17-runs/S-16.log:492:.planning/phases/17-code-oss-smoke-scenario-hardening-20-attach-scenarios-driven/17-S08-FINDINGS.md:10:S-08 surfaced two distinct dap-cli behaviors that combined into "agent attaches to agent host but cannot pause or set breakpoints." Both are reproducible. This note locates the code, explains the failure mode, and proposes a minimal fix for each. No code changes landed in this commit — fixes need explicit sign-off because they touch core routing.
