tmp/phase-17-runs/S-16.log:495:.planning/phases/17-code-oss-smoke-scenario-hardening-20-attach-scenarios-driven/17-S08-FINDINGS.md:48:- `dap-cli pause --thread-id 0` returns `success: true` immediately.
